WEBVTT

00:08.120 --> 00:11.410
Sera, you've really improved!

00:11.410 --> 00:13.420
And you used to be 
such a cute little thing.

00:15.160 --> 00:19.850
I trained extensively because I wanted 
to be a great knight like you!

00:19.850 --> 00:22.200
What a sweet thing to say!

00:22.440 --> 00:23.480
Incredible.

00:23.880 --> 00:25.830
Lady Serafina is strong enough

00:25.830 --> 00:29.060
to stand against the legendary 
Princess Wysteresia!

00:29.500 --> 00:32.980
I wouldn't be so sure. 
They are only training, after all.

00:32.980 --> 00:37.600
And Lady Wysteresia has always 
preferred wielding two swords.

00:37.820 --> 00:40.850
Looks like I won't need to hold 
back against you anymore!

00:41.120 --> 00:43.870
Right! Please, fight seriously!

00:58.760 --> 01:00.080
Wow...

01:07.120 --> 01:11.460
Your skill with a blade lives 
up to your legend, Resia!

01:11.690 --> 01:14.170
Those eyes of yours do you credit.

01:14.170 --> 01:15.990
You're already used to my strikes?

01:15.990 --> 01:16.680
Still...

01:25.900 --> 01:28.310
You've become a fine knight, Sera.

01:29.050 --> 01:31.680
If you weren't holding back 
out of admiration for me,

01:31.680 --> 01:34.190
I bet you'd be stronger than I am.

01:34.190 --> 01:39.070
If you really feel that way, 
why resort to blinding me with dirt?

01:39.070 --> 01:41.290
I wouldn't have, if I wanted 
to fight like a knight.

01:41.290 --> 01:43.820
But we've got fire-breathing 
dragons in these parts.

01:43.820 --> 01:48.580
You start getting all huffy over a bit 
of dirt, and you'll be dead in no time!

01:48.840 --> 01:51.040
The willingness to resort 
to whatever it takes,

01:51.040 --> 01:53.670
while still maintaining such 
refined and vigorous willpower.

01:53.670 --> 01:59.590
Who she is at her core remains unchanged.
She's still direct and brilliant.

02:00.420 --> 02:02.010
Come to think of it...

02:03.430 --> 02:05.730
There was the time she disguised 
herself as a village girl

02:05.730 --> 02:07.630
to destroy a bandit hideout...

02:17.810 --> 02:20.870
By intentionally getting kidnapped.

02:21.110 --> 02:22.400
It's her willingness to use

02:22.400 --> 02:24.870
such free-wheeling tactics 
unbecoming of a knight...

02:28.600 --> 02:31.650
that gave rise to so many legends...

02:33.370 --> 02:36.760
You're absolutely right, Sister. 
I'll try and keep that in mind.

02:40.360 --> 02:45.180
Sorry, Sera. I got some dirt 
on your engagement necklace.

02:45.720 --> 02:47.410
Oh, really?

02:47.410 --> 02:50.510
Yeah. Wash it off later, okay?

02:50.510 --> 02:53.630
I thought it didn't come off?

02:53.980 --> 02:55.250
Of course it does.

02:56.380 --> 02:59.040
Why'd you think it wouldn't?

02:59.040 --> 03:01.200
There's no latch...

03:01.200 --> 03:02.910
Did Veo not explain?

03:03.570 --> 03:05.940
If you will it to come off, it does.

03:07.340 --> 03:09.290
How does that work?!

03:09.720 --> 03:12.480
It reacts to willpower.

03:13.030 --> 03:15.920
Try touching it while wishing 
strongly for it to come off.

03:17.370 --> 03:18.410
Okay...

03:20.920 --> 03:22.180
Come off!

03:26.530 --> 03:30.630
Then even something 
like this is enchanted?

03:31.190 --> 03:36.080
Well, if a weapon's enchantment reacts 
to the desire to defend or attack,

03:36.080 --> 03:39.170
is it really that strange that there's 
a necklace that reacts to the desire

03:39.170 --> 03:40.190
to come undone?

03:40.190 --> 03:41.700
I see...

03:42.090 --> 03:46.450
The idea is that the necklace would 
come off if you didn't want it.

03:46.450 --> 03:48.810
I-I see...

03:50.010 --> 03:55.050
She didn't seem to catch on to what 
that implies since it never came off...

04:04.230 --> 04:05.840
There we go.

04:06.350 --> 04:08.470
An engagement necklace...

04:09.410 --> 04:13.150
Wh-Wh-What am I thinking?!

04:15.360 --> 04:16.060
Attach!

04:17.730 --> 04:19.810
Necklace! Attach!

04:19.810 --> 04:22.560
Attach! Attach?!

04:25.150 --> 04:26.490
It won't attach...

04:26.950 --> 04:29.340
B-But why?

04:45.970 --> 04:53.610
The Warrior Princess and the Barbaric King

06:01.090 --> 06:02.880
You can't put the necklace back on?

06:02.880 --> 06:06.020
I've been wishing strongly 
for it to do so, but...

06:06.510 --> 06:08.630
It just won't change back.

06:09.470 --> 06:11.650
What do you suppose is going on?

06:11.650 --> 06:13.890
Oh, well to put it back on...

06:15.560 --> 06:18.100
There's a little ritual.

06:18.100 --> 06:21.390
You need to sneak up on the person 
who gave it to you, from behind...

06:21.390 --> 06:24.150
Douse them with water, 
to cleanse them, and then...

06:26.300 --> 06:29.520
You go like this and whisper "Guess who?"

06:30.020 --> 06:31.570
Right in their ear.

06:33.250 --> 06:34.440
Try saying it.

06:35.530 --> 06:37.410
G-Guess who...?

06:38.740 --> 06:40.330
Sexier!

06:40.790 --> 06:42.390
U-Um...

06:42.770 --> 06:44.560
Guess who?

06:45.010 --> 06:46.490
Not like that!

06:46.490 --> 06:49.450
Put some real femininity in it, 
like a mature, older woman!

06:49.450 --> 06:51.550
What does that even mean?

06:53.780 --> 06:55.690
G-Guess...

06:56.560 --> 06:58.570
Guess who?

06:59.610 --> 07:01.080
You're getting there!

07:01.080 --> 07:04.020
You'll wanna include notes 
of purity, open mindedness,

07:04.020 --> 07:06.050
and strength that calls to mind

07:06.050 --> 07:09.040
the harshness of the eastern lands!

07:09.040 --> 07:10.900
I'm not sure I follow!

07:11.160 --> 07:15.130
Then when he calls your name, 
 it'll be a nice little setup.

07:16.370 --> 07:20.760
And all of this childishness will really 
let me put the necklace back on?

07:20.760 --> 07:24.640
The more primitive the ritual, 
that more it tends to be like that.

07:24.640 --> 07:26.920
Is that really the case?

07:26.920 --> 07:27.460
Wait...

07:27.750 --> 07:31.340
I have to do all this... to Veor?!

07:31.650 --> 07:32.840
You sure do.

07:32.840 --> 07:35.100
What do you think? Can you pull it off?

07:35.540 --> 07:38.610
Um... I think... so?

07:41.380 --> 07:42.480
I'll do it!

07:42.480 --> 07:43.600
Awesome!

07:43.950 --> 07:48.020
That said, you gotta keep the 
necklace coming off a secret.

07:48.020 --> 07:50.090
Don't let Veo see you.

07:50.090 --> 07:52.990
That seems like a much bigger challenge...

07:56.030 --> 07:57.190
I'm going to borrow this basin.

07:57.190 --> 07:59.510
Huh? Oh, certainly.

08:01.280 --> 08:04.390
Ma'am, why did you tell her... all that?

08:04.390 --> 08:08.670
None of it is necessary to 
put the necklace back on.

08:09.700 --> 08:11.760
I just said it'd be a nice setup!

08:11.760 --> 08:14.420
Not that it'd let her put it back on.

08:14.420 --> 08:16.930
I mean, we're talking about Veo and Sera.

08:16.930 --> 08:21.010
How many years do you think we'd have to 
wait if we don't give them a little push?

08:21.010 --> 08:23.140
This comes a little too close to meddling.

08:24.390 --> 08:28.870
I'd just like my grandchild to 
see me while I'm still pretty.

08:30.350 --> 08:32.400
You're getting ahead of yourself.

08:41.190 --> 08:46.230
I can't let him see me, and I have 
to douse him with this water...

08:46.900 --> 08:47.790
Here goes!

08:48.330 --> 08:52.020
Thanks ever so much. 
It was so darn heavy...

08:52.020 --> 08:55.300
A bit of firewood was no trouble at all.

08:55.590 --> 08:56.690
Up.

08:56.690 --> 08:59.250
What is it? Why do you want up?

09:07.560 --> 09:09.240
Wh-What was that?!

09:09.240 --> 09:13.440
Forgive me, Veor! 
I'll wholeheartedly apologize later!

09:13.440 --> 09:16.830
It seems the best way to do this would 
be in a place with no one else around...

09:17.700 --> 09:20.630
Did it just rain, but only 
on Master Thunder Voice?

09:21.890 --> 09:23.950
I couldn't tell you, myself.

09:27.040 --> 09:31.130
Sera wouldn't do that sort 
of thing without some reason.

09:31.850 --> 09:33.630
You want to know Master Veor's schedule?

09:34.980 --> 09:38.300
I thought it best to target 
my quarry when they're alone.

09:38.300 --> 09:40.380
Quarry...?

09:40.380 --> 09:43.320
You're taking this more 
seriously than I thought.

09:43.320 --> 09:44.590
Of course.

09:44.900 --> 09:47.920
It is a knight's duty to see something 
through once they've started it.

09:47.920 --> 09:49.020
Is it now?

09:49.500 --> 09:52.250
You nobles really are such a pain.

09:52.250 --> 09:57.530
What Veor's doing today and
where he's going. Anything will do.

09:58.930 --> 10:00.910
Mother, where is Sera?

10:01.230 --> 10:03.350
Stepped out for something.

10:03.350 --> 10:04.540
I see.

10:05.260 --> 10:06.660
Hold it right there!

10:06.930 --> 10:10.040
Are things going well 
between you and Sera?

10:11.340 --> 10:13.060
Have a seat.

10:14.140 --> 10:19.550
Listen up. If you care about 
a woman, you need to show her.

10:19.960 --> 10:21.440
How do I do that...?

10:21.440 --> 10:23.060
With a gift! As a symbol.

10:23.060 --> 10:27.300
Think of it as an offering 
to the woman you love!

10:28.190 --> 10:33.290
I don't suppose you could tell me 
what would be a good gift, Mother.

10:33.290 --> 10:34.940
Use your own damn head...

10:35.410 --> 10:38.440
is what I'd normally say, but...

10:39.210 --> 10:42.200
How about something unusual to eat?

10:43.200 --> 10:46.190
And then you make it into 
something delicious to eat,

10:46.190 --> 10:48.490
so that it really means something.

10:48.850 --> 10:50.630
That's more mundane than I thought.

10:51.630 --> 10:53.610
I'm going to check on the saplings.

10:54.720 --> 10:57.840
You'll wanna look for something nearby,
but with as few people around as possible!

10:57.840 --> 11:01.010
Someplace you could knock boots 
and no one would hear it!

11:01.010 --> 11:04.220
Knock...?! Really, Mother?!

11:07.190 --> 11:10.350
Master Veor went to check on the saplings.

11:10.350 --> 11:12.860
The place where the great 
cleansing was performed, then.

11:13.270 --> 11:16.230
There's plenty of cover to shadow 
him while staying hidden!

11:16.520 --> 11:19.350
To say nothing of spots 
to sneak up behind him!

11:19.350 --> 11:22.240
Just try not to be a nuisance.

11:22.240 --> 11:25.580
Don't worry! I'll apologize later!

11:25.580 --> 11:28.500
That really isn't the point!

11:29.500 --> 11:31.800
Why am I stuck doing this?!

11:31.800 --> 11:32.760
Malcius.

11:34.230 --> 11:38.940
Serafina de Lavillant is taking 
to the field of battle.

11:38.940 --> 11:40.510
Huh? Okay.

11:41.200 --> 11:43.510
Something unusual to eat...

11:43.780 --> 11:46.670
Well, the saplings seem to have 
taken to the ground well enough.

11:46.670 --> 11:49.780
There's nothing as wondrous as 
seeing greenery restored to land

11:49.780 --> 11:51.060
that was once close to death.

11:52.230 --> 11:54.270
Forgive me, Veor!

11:57.580 --> 12:01.410
He reacted to the slight 
surge of willpower just now!

12:01.410 --> 12:02.280
Sera...?

12:05.670 --> 12:07.380
What are you doing out here?

12:07.380 --> 12:08.540
Stay back!

12:08.870 --> 12:11.210
Don't come any closer, please!

12:11.810 --> 12:16.040
I can't be seen in the middle 
of the ritual! Forgive me!

12:21.610 --> 12:22.780
Ritual...?

12:27.380 --> 12:30.180
This is going to be more 
difficult than I thought.

12:33.200 --> 12:34.190
But still!

12:34.540 --> 12:36.850
Perhaps a more offensive 
approach will work!

13:23.140 --> 13:27.660
Honestly, Sera... I'm not 
sure the hat is helping.

13:34.480 --> 13:37.630
He notices me every single time!

13:37.630 --> 13:39.920
What is he, a wild animal?!

13:39.920 --> 13:44.440
How am I ever going to 
sneak up behind him?!

13:44.440 --> 13:48.490
I wonder what's wrong 
with Lady Serafina today.

13:49.300 --> 13:52.310
Life can be fine a second time around...

13:55.500 --> 13:56.880
What do I do?

13:57.530 --> 14:02.770
No! I told Resia I would do this,
 so I can't just give up!

14:03.300 --> 14:06.260
Actually, this has nothing to do with her!

14:06.260 --> 14:10.590
As a knight, I've begun this undertaking! 
It's not unlike taking an oath!

14:10.590 --> 14:14.090
So this ritual will be a success!

14:14.090 --> 14:17.400
Wait... I know.

14:17.400 --> 14:19.940
One of Resia's legends may hold the key!

14:25.470 --> 14:27.580
It had gotten a bit long.

14:27.900 --> 14:30.390
How were the saplings?

14:30.390 --> 14:33.610
No problems there, but...

14:33.610 --> 14:36.560
There's something that's 
been bothering me.

14:36.830 --> 14:38.550
What's that?

14:38.860 --> 14:41.960
Sera's been acting rather strange.

14:42.900 --> 14:45.790
It's like she has some business with me...

14:45.790 --> 14:48.330
But when I try to talk 
to her, she runs off.

14:50.630 --> 14:51.570
Cersei?

14:52.230 --> 14:56.080
Keep the crock ritual a 
secret from Veo, got it?

14:58.620 --> 15:03.340
I wonder if I've done 
something to upset her.

15:03.340 --> 15:06.890
I... I don't think that's the case!

15:06.890 --> 15:10.470
Um... Does anything come to mind?

15:10.470 --> 15:12.970
One thing.

15:13.850 --> 15:15.810
The engagement necklace.

15:21.650 --> 15:27.110
I put it on her when she was brought 
here, while she was asleep.

15:27.450 --> 15:30.690
I had intended to tell her 
what it represented...

15:30.690 --> 15:33.870
but in the end, Mother told her first.

15:35.250 --> 15:39.370
I may have been afraid... 
of being rejected.

15:41.370 --> 15:45.380
So I was happy enough that 
she was wearing it at all...

15:45.840 --> 15:49.260
Putting the issue aside, 
instead of addressing it.

15:50.150 --> 15:51.760
Master Veor...

15:52.070 --> 15:57.610
It could be that she's upset with 
my cowardice, in regards to that.

15:57.610 --> 15:59.270
That she finds me pitiful.

16:00.100 --> 16:05.650
I don't think Sera would be disappointed 
in you over something like that.

16:06.100 --> 16:08.650
Not when you're trying so hard.

16:09.140 --> 16:10.950
I hope you're right.

16:11.560 --> 16:13.050
Don't worry.

16:18.810 --> 16:25.920
I think I may need to face her again 
and tell her how I truly feel.

16:26.880 --> 16:28.670
I'm sorry for suddenly calling on you!

16:29.190 --> 16:34.050
But I need your cooperation! 
Are you willing to help?

16:34.050 --> 16:36.680
Wh-Wh-What is this?! And so suddenly!

16:36.910 --> 16:39.550
It's something I can only ask you to do.

16:39.550 --> 16:43.690
But, with this plan, 
rooted in the legends of Resia...!

16:44.370 --> 16:46.190
I'm sure it will succeed.

16:46.470 --> 16:47.990
A plan...?

16:49.320 --> 16:53.210
Could it be that Lady Serafina is 
finally fed up with these barbarians

16:53.210 --> 16:56.110
and is scheming to escape with me?!

16:57.450 --> 17:00.080
I-If it's something I can do to help!

17:00.080 --> 17:02.900
Really?! Thank you so much!

17:03.380 --> 17:04.610
Let's get started, then.

17:09.940 --> 17:11.840
Lady Serafina?!

17:15.830 --> 17:16.950
Sera?

17:17.750 --> 17:18.640
Where is she going?

17:20.850 --> 17:24.100
W-Wait, please! 
I need to talk to you!

17:24.570 --> 17:25.490
Sera!

17:27.900 --> 17:29.110
Sera...

17:33.830 --> 17:35.240
Wh-What the—

17:35.240 --> 17:37.110
I have you now!

17:42.530 --> 17:43.800
Egads!

17:43.800 --> 17:47.910
Damn you, Veor... You had a weapon 
like this up your sleeve?!

17:47.910 --> 17:50.860
I should've expected as much from the 
man who can fight me to a standstill!

17:50.860 --> 17:51.540
And yet—

17:53.830 --> 17:58.050
I won't be beaten!

18:01.380 --> 18:03.310
Guess who?

18:05.310 --> 18:10.060
Uh... That voice could really 
only belong to one person...

18:10.540 --> 18:14.170
What is this? Am I being 
tested in some way?

18:14.490 --> 18:17.340
Answer me. What's my name?

18:17.880 --> 18:20.820
Your name is Sera.

18:20.820 --> 18:24.590
Serafina de Lavillant. Is it not?

18:28.350 --> 18:29.540
Sera...

18:29.540 --> 18:32.000
Necklace! Attach!

18:39.210 --> 18:41.260
Wh-Why isn't it working?!

18:41.260 --> 18:44.260
Sera... could you explain what's going on?

18:44.640 --> 18:49.270
Um, well... Resia told 
me about the ritual...

18:49.550 --> 18:52.800
Since I took the necklace 
off and... well...

18:53.920 --> 18:55.280
So, this is Mother's doing.

18:57.530 --> 19:00.820
It's obviously nonsense.

19:13.810 --> 19:17.550
Mother... could you please refrain 
from teasing Sera like this?

19:18.960 --> 19:23.500
I just told her it'd be a nice setup. 
Not an untrue word was spoken.

19:23.500 --> 19:25.810
Besides, without a little 
extra motivation...

19:27.360 --> 19:29.850
I'm sorry for what she did.

19:29.850 --> 19:36.360
No, I should've remembered that 
Sister can be... capricious.

19:36.620 --> 19:42.050
All right, that's enough apologizing, 
let's enjoy this grub Cersei made us!

19:42.850 --> 19:47.080
I think Sera's perception of you as a 
heroic princess who met a tragic end...

19:47.080 --> 19:49.800
might color her perception.

19:49.800 --> 19:51.330
You might be right.

19:52.180 --> 19:54.520
I really do need to apologize.

19:54.520 --> 19:57.820
I was such a nuisance... 
I hope you can forgive me.

19:59.640 --> 20:04.590
No, it was nothing you should 
worry about. If anything...

20:06.570 --> 20:10.100
Sera... would you join me for a bit?

20:11.350 --> 20:12.570
For what?

20:12.570 --> 20:14.600
O-Okay.

20:20.530 --> 20:22.610
Wh-What's wrong?

20:26.080 --> 20:27.970
May I see the necklace?

20:28.830 --> 20:30.560
O-Okay.

20:32.160 --> 20:36.000
In order to put this on, 
an oath must be recited.

20:36.410 --> 20:38.000
An oath...?

20:38.600 --> 20:44.510
Sera, I would like to once again 
give you this engagement necklace.

20:47.380 --> 20:48.470
Is that all right?

20:48.470 --> 20:49.990
S-Sure!

20:49.990 --> 20:54.270
I'm... not... against it.

20:54.860 --> 20:57.020
I feel anxious without it, frankly.

20:57.020 --> 20:58.870
Honestly...

20:58.870 --> 21:02.680
You have no idea how happy 
it makes me to hear that.

21:03.780 --> 21:07.960
Thundering maelstrom whose domain is 
between the earth and the stormclouds,

21:07.960 --> 21:10.870
divine dragon whose will is law...

21:11.440 --> 21:14.540
Armor of rulers, Orkfiem.

21:25.050 --> 21:30.850
In thy glorious name, 
I hereby forge this bond.

21:31.190 --> 21:37.410
I bid you to unite this maiden and I.

21:40.020 --> 21:44.740
And for as long as she 
holds me in her heart,

21:44.740 --> 21:48.130
until such a time as my life ends...

21:48.130 --> 21:50.530
let our fates be intertwined.

21:55.370 --> 22:00.460
That is the prayer pact necessary 
to put the necklace on.

22:01.080 --> 22:05.140
I hope it conveyed to 
you how I honestly feel.

22:06.940 --> 22:09.480
Y-Yes!

22:13.520 --> 22:16.230
Translation: Lee Francis

Timing: Andy Ellis

Editing: Zachary Carlysle

Quality Control: Salem Alabanza

Translation Check: Sho Stifler

22:16.230 --> 22:19.510
I wonder how Veo's doing.

22:19.510 --> 22:21.480
Not that I care...

22:22.280 --> 22:23.970
but what do we do with her?

22:25.840 --> 22:28.740
Lady Serafina...!

22:30.370 --> 22:32.190
I feel kinda bad...

22:32.190 --> 22:34.260
Should I pat her head?

22:34.600 --> 22:38.160
I don't think you should sully 
your hands like that, ma'am.

22:43.660 --> 22:45.730
Looks like it went well.
